!2sCIABIhBLVli1NwARJSd_yLA-AiQx\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dugc_photo_posts\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0x1d2e88d3b4b61705",null,null,"0ahUKEwjL1KGDwdKWAxXXjK8BHaSZN_YQ-y4IjwIoAA"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,[10,"CIABIhBLVli1NwARJSd_yLA-AiQx"],[10,3,[4284,4284]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["山形心心拉麵"]],[null,[[["Alvin"],"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102456625610588903411?hl\u003dzh-TW","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV4GQy-NnnXNifSZZexNHKM4Xkv1FmNFTNTbQMBbCU1Z3YFaL6gTw\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",null,null,"102456625610588903411"]]],[[[2],[[null,null,null,null,1]]]],[2,null,null,null,null,[null,null,null,[7,3]],null,null,[2026,6,9,14,null,null,null,null,["2 個月前"]]],["//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhBLVli1NwARJSd_yLA-AiQx\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dugc_photo_posts\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0x1d2e88d3b4b61705"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["0","2102768518879909637"],null,null,[null,1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHRjRjlvT25obFdqTnlSR3hhT1V3MlJrUXhaekV4YzFwRFVtYxAB"]],"CIABIhBLVli1NwARJSd_yLA-AiQx",1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["📍山形心心拉麵\n\n這次點了「豚野郎拉麵 辛味噌口味」，一上桌就是滿滿二郎系風格的震撼感。高高堆起的豆芽菜、蒜末、辣味噌與厚切叉燒，份量十足，視覺效果相當有衝擊力。\n\n湯頭以味噌為基底，除了濃郁鹹香之外，還帶著一絲微微酸感，與一般重鹹重油的二郎系拉麵有所不同。\n搭配店家特製辣味噌後，多了些辛香與層次，喝起來濃厚卻不會過於死鹹，反而多了幾分開胃感。\n\n麵條保有彈性與咬勁，能完整吸附湯汁；大量豆芽菜增加爽脆口感，也讓整體吃起來不會過於膩口。叉燒厚實有誠意，肉質偏乾，入口後能感受到豬肉本身的香氣與油脂甜味。\n\n整體來說，是一碗兼具份量、濃郁度與特色風味的二郎系拉麵。尤其那帶有微酸感的辛味噌湯頭令人印象深刻，讓重口味之餘多了一些平衡感。喜歡二郎系拉麵、蒜香與濃厚湯頭的朋友，值得來試試。\n2026.06",null,[0,81]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6762372654130041113/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMjVvYkZkcVRubFNSM2hoVDFWM01sSnJVWGhhZWtWNFl6RndSRlZ0WXhBQhAB",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6762372654130041113/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhSalJqbHZUMjVvYkZkcVRubFNSM2hoVDFWM01sSnJVWGhhZWtWNFl6RndSRlZ0WXhBQhAB"],"https