l,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["只要和朋友到士林夜市，我都會帶他們到此用餐.....\n\n這裡店家是日本師傅所開設，店裡人員全是日本人！\n老闆人都親切又有禮貌！\n\n二郎系拉麵是重點必點.....這次帶著兒子前去用餐點了一碗豚野郎元味及豚野郎辛味......\n因為知道自己食量，因此都點了小碗......\n\n不愧是二郎系拉麵量多、湯頭濃郁滑順\n一下子我就嗑完....\n\n兒子還吵著說要點中碗結果小碗吃不完，只好幫他吃完剩下.....\n\n整體而言 ：老闆人親切誠意滿滿不馬虎 二郎系好吃",null,[0,51]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6762372654130041113/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFaZW1OVldrMWlNRTB3VTNwck1GVXhTbEppUjJoQ1VXdDRZV05JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6762372654130041113/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFaZW1OVldrMWlNRTB3VTNwck1GVXhTbEppUjJoQ1VXdDRZV05JWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6762372654130041113/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFaZW1OVldrMWlNRTB3VTNwck1GVXhTbEppUjJoQ1VXdDRZV05JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6762372654130041113/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFaZW1OVldrMWlNRTB3VTNwck1GVXhTbEppUjJoQ1VXdDRZV05JWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6762372654130041113/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFaZW1OVldrMWlNRTB3VTNwck1GVXhTbEppUjJoQ1VXdDRZV05JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6762372654130041113/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFaZW1OVldrMWlNRTB3VTNwck1GVXhTbEppUjJoQ1VXdDRZV05JWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,4275,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ZemNVWk1iME0wU3prMFUxSlJiR2hCUWt4YWNIYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1d2e88d3b4b61705!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmYzcUZMb0M0Szk0U1JRbGhBQkxacHc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ZemNVWk1iME0wU3prMFUxSlJiR2hCUWt4YWNIYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ZemNVWk1iME0wU3prMFUxSlJiR2hCUWt4YWNIYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21ZemNVWk1iME0wU3prMFUxSlJiR